{"4173110":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Cirno! Lifts a Boulder","steam_appid":4173110,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4467280],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Boulder is No Match for This Fairy!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mischievous group of fairies has locked Cirno out of her very own home by placing a huge boulder right in front of it. Luckily for Cirno, getting rid of it is simple: she just needs to get <strong>stronger<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How? By collecting Power items, of course!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4173110\/extras\/1e438b7eb72284b270abc12a1ff7d9eb.poster.avif?t=1776004489\" width=780 height=128 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4173110\/extras\/1e438b7eb72284b270abc12a1ff7d9eb.webm?t=1776004489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cirno! Lifts a Boulder<\/i> is a short and relaxing 3D platformer and Touhou fangame in which the titular ice fairy explores a frozen-over Misty Lake in search of strength-granting items. As Cirno grows more powerful, she unlocks distinct abilities that help her navigate the snowy landscape and reach new areas.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4173110\/extras\/29c4711ab099c92ed5a7e98f1ff26546.poster.avif?t=1776004489\" width=780 height=128 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4173110\/extras\/29c4711ab099c92ed5a7e98f1ff26546.webm?t=1776004489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Misty Lake any way you like<\/strong>: you never know what you might run into!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set your own pace<\/strong>: There's no rush. Sprint across the ice, or take a leisurely walk along the lakeshore.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock abilities<\/strong>: As Cirno gets stronger, she gradually remembers what an ice fairy is truly capable of.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find hidden frogs<\/strong>: Several sneaky frogs are hiding around the lake. Can you find them all?<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen to some tunes<\/strong>: Get lost in the snow with an arranged soundtrack by lapspider45!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4173110\/extras\/c1b2f073e1d5068a3eb4f46196ed5bc9.poster.avif?t=1776004489\" width=780 height=128 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4173110\/extras\/c1b2f073e1d5068a3eb4f46196ed5bc9.webm?t=1776004489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4173110\/extras\/da7f42d0ee2f81fb02621717e62de17e.avif?t=1776004489\" width=512 height=256 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Boulder is No Match for This Fairy!<\/strong><\